# Keep LF everywhere, even in a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true:
# CRLF would change file contents (re-triggering every run_onchange_ script),
# break #! lines, and leak \r into generated configs. PowerShell and Python
# both read LF files fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
